  "notes": [
    "Free limit resets now show in Plan usage whenever you have any left, right under your limits, with what each clears, how many are left and the date to use it by. They are read the same way Claude Code reads them, so ones it offers now show here too.",
    "The weekly session reset (it clears your 5-hour limit once a week) shows there too while you are at a limit, and Use one uses it.",
    "Before you use a reset while you are still under the limit, the site says how much of it you have left, so a reset is not used by accident."
  ],
